{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkdAB1TEKUi2DT9tt9ug","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**What I'd do:** open an account at פסגות and buy \"ילין לפידות מחקה S&P 500 (4D)\", 500 ₪ a month. The page says I'd have about **86,492 ₪** after 10 years. I'm fairly sure, but not fully. What decided it is that the box marked \"הבחירה שלכם · הזול\" put those two together. I know פסגות from ads, so that was enough for me.\n\n**One catch:** that 86,492 is for the page's own numbers, 10,000 ₪ now plus 500 a month at 7%. It isn't for my 30,000. I didn't change the boxes, so my real number would be higher, and I don't know by how much.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **First screen:** I saw the heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\", that S&P 500 was already chosen, the boxes (10,000 / 500 / 10 years / 7%) and the big numbers. \"הפקדתם 70,000 ₪\" turned into 86,492 ₪, and next to it \"הזוג הבא בתור\" showed 86,449, only \"−43 ₪\" less. So the difference hardly matters.\n- **Second screen:** At the top was a coloured bar with a legend I didn't read, plus \"1 ₪ יותר\", \"58 ₪ פחות\" and \"14 ₪ יותר\". I don't know what these are compared to. On the right was the list of banks. פסגות came first, \"הזול\", with \"1,057 ₪\" over 10 years. לאומי was \"−3,096\". On the left, the fund was ילין לפידות 5139282, with \"דמי ניהול 0%\". I didn't get what \"נאמן 0.02%\" means.\n- **Screens 3–5:** I scrolled with my thumb. Lots of funds and lots of banks with red minus numbers, getting bigger: אלטשולר and מיטב over −20,000. That put me off them. Then came a few English funds (iShares, Vanguard), and one with \"בין +2,212 ל־−23,766\", which scared me. I stopped at the bottom of screen 5, at \"מה הכי משנה את מה שיישאר לכם\". I didn't look at screens 6–10.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** נאמן, צוברת, מחלקת דיבידנד, מנוטרלת מט\"ח, ממונף (\"4D\"/\"4A\"), חשיפה לדולר, \"סל\", W-8BEN, \"לא בחישוב\", \"אין שנה מלאה\".\n\n**What I'd change:** Put the bank name and the fund name right next to the big 86,492 on the first screen, so I don't have to scroll to find out what \"הזול\" is. The 1,057 ₪ under פסגות and the 0 ₪ next to it confused me: is it a cost or not? There are too many tags on every fund. The two lists are so long I almost got lost."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1875,"cache_read_input_tokens":12038,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1875},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"55b28e1f-db35-40f5-8051-5673bad09d6f","uuid":"61146aab-ba5b-477d-bb1d-4b3fa154e7d9","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:09:46.037Z","request_id":"req_011CgkdAAoZNESNxsf7w4CxL"}
